ooc:include/collect:
====================

This directory contains public interfaces for the COllection Phylum
as documented in [Cox86].  Since the current release from StepStone
(version 4) has generalized these classes, I have also moved them to
the side.  They are included mostly for reference purposes.

The import directives have been removed from these header files.

--- brian witt (July 14, 1990)
--- brian witt (September 19, 1993)

